      "title": {
        "en": "Caring and knowledgeable veterinary doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend Dr. Ori, Dr. Jordan, Dr. Laura, and their nursing staff for their thoroughness, patience, and empathetic approach. Reviewers note that the team explains diagnostic tests and treatment options in detail without making owners feel rushed. While most feedback is glowing, a couple of clients felt let down during emergency situations or unresolved conditions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize how comfortable their dogs and cats feel at this Brickell Key facility. Reviewers share that veterinary assistants and doctors take special care with nervous or reactive pets, sitting on the floor and offering treats during checkups. Many clients report that pets who normally dread clinic visits remain relaxed and happy throughout examinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and travel documentation"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers praise the clinic team for attentive and transparent communication regarding medical findings, treatment plans, and international pet travel documentation. Clients appreciate that veterinarians dedicate ample time to answer questions over the phone and in person, providing reassurance and guiding owners through complex health certificate requirements."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where is Wags Animal Hospital located?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The veterinary clinic is located on Brickell Key Drive on Brickell Key, easily accessible for pet owners living in the Brickell area."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic assist with international pet travel certificates?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently report seamless experiences obtaining USDA and international health certificates for traveling dogs and cats."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is parking available for clinic visitors?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic validates parking tickets for visitors parking in the Brickell Key parking facilities."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
